              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igihugu kizogeza ryari kuboroga, n’ivyatsi vyo mu ntāra yose gukabirana? Kubg’ ibibi vy’abakibamwo ibikōko n’inyoni bikimazwemwo: kuko bavuga, bat’ Ivy’ iherezo ryacu nta ho azobibona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
